 reedom-loving Canadians who stood firmly with Shen Yun\, we are proud to 
 say: the show will go on.\n\n\nAfter a triumphant 2026 world tour across 
 200 cities\, Shen Yun makes a special return trip to Toronto this June.\n
 \n\nIt is more than a performance. It’s a celebration of beauty\, resilie
 nce\, and the enduring spirit of freedom.\n\n\nCome make yourself part of
  it\, securely and joyfully.
