 5 @ 10:00 PM\nTue\, July 7 @ 7:45 PM\nFri\, July 10 @ 5:30 PM\nSat\, July
  11 @ 7:45 PM\nSun\, July 12 @ 2:30 PM\n\n\n🎟️ TICKETS 🎟️\nwww.WizardSh
