SUMMARY: Rosé Picnic: Toronto’s Largest Premium Picnic
DESCRIPTION:The 9th Annual Rosé Picnic returns July 11\, 2026 to the Cana
 dian Film Centre on Toronto’s historic Windfields Estate for a 19+ summer
  celebration unlike any other. Dress in pink and white and step into a vi
 brant rosé garden where wine\, fashion\, music\, and beautifully set picn
 ic grounds come together for one of the city’s most anticipated summer ga
 therings.\n\nEvery ticket includes a welcome pour of rosé and a take-home
  wine glass\, with access to premium rosé selections\, custom cocktails\,
  gourmet food stations\, live DJs\, the Pink Carpet Fashion Show\, and th
 e Beauty and Lifestyle Garden featuring standout Canadian brands.\n\nPriv
 ate picnic tables\, VIP Lounge experiences\, and custom suites are availa
 ble for those who prefer elevated hosting space.\n\nLicensed 19+. Valid I
 D required. Rain or shine. No refunds. No re-entry permitted.\n\nTickets 
 and details at http://rosepicnic.com
