SUMMARY: Bleeding Edge Presents: TORONTO APARTMENT
DESCRIPTION:On July 15\, Bleeding Edge invites you to join us at Paradise
  Theatre for the Canadian premiere of Toronto Apartment\, the laugh-a-min
 ute DIY comedy from local writer/director/editor Tristan Wheeler. Tickets
  available HERE! https://paradiseonbloor.com/movies/toronto-apartment/\n\
 nBleeding Edge previously played Wheeler’s short films Poet Laureate http
 s://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y7O3jfQ1sPM and I’m Sorry Cody https://vimeo.
 com/1042470309 \, and we are excited to also bring you his feature debut!
  Toronto Apartment was made for $10\,000 with the assistance of many peop
 le within the Bleeding Edge community. Lock\, a recently dumped layabout\
 , rents out his apartment for an hour or two at at a time as a “community
  space” in order to pay the bills\, which triggers a dangerous series of 
 events for both Lock and the city of Toronto. It had it’s world premiere 
 last month at the Mammoth Lakes Film Festival\, where rural California au
 diences learned about the cost of housing in Toronto and our uniquely Can
 adian affordability crisis. Wheeler\, along with many of his collaborator
 s\, will be in attendance for a Q&A at the screening.
CATEGORIES:Film,Paradise-Theatre,Comedy
