SUMMARY: The Lone Wolf live music series featuring Lucas Silveira
DESCRIPTION:The Lone Wolf live music series is a monthly stripped down\, 
 up close and personal community talent showcase at Mama's Liquor and Loun
 ge - 1602 Dundas West. 7pm - 11pm. PWYC. To see a list of this month’s co
 mmunity stage performers go to @ http://thelaneway.ca on Instagram.\n\nEa
 ch month the night will headline with a unique and exclusive set from one
  of Toronto's finest from 10pm - 11pm.\n\nJuly 16th featured performer:\n
 \nLucas Silveira!\n\nMore about Lucas…\n\nLucas Silveira is the first ope
 nly transgender man to be signed to a major label record deal. Founder of
  The Cliks\, he has toured internationally and shared stages with artists
  including Cyndi Lauper\, Debbie Harry\, and Tegan and Sara. Performing a
  mix of original music and contemporary covers\, Lucas delivers an intima
 te acoustic show driven by powerful vocals and heart.\n\nwww.thecliks.com
  http://www.thecliks.com\n\nWant to play a future community stage?\n\nE-m
 ail thelaneway.ca@gmail.com mailto:thelaneway.ca@gmail.com - tell us abou
 t yourself and send samples of your work!
CATEGORIES:Concert,Mama's-Liquor-&-Lounge,lucas-silveira,queer-events
