SUMMARY: Breathtaking Gardens at Casa Loma
DESCRIPTION:Just in time for summer\, Casa Loma is transforming the castl
 e into Breathtaking Gardens\, a new Sunday morning wellness series runnin
 g June 7 through August 30\, 2026.\n\nPresented in partnership with Soul 
 Expansion\, the 13-week series invites guests to recharge through immersi
 ve live-music sessions led by Freddy Gervasi and The Band of Souls\, alon
 g with local wellness instructors who guide yoga\, Pilates\, and somatic 
 movement.\n\nSet against Casa Loma’s lush summer gardens\, the series off
 ers a restorative start to the week in one of the city’s most iconic sett
 ings\, with each session designed to calm the mind and support the body’s
  natural flow.
CATEGORIES:Concert,Casa-Loma
