BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Toronto Events (Tockify)
UID:TKF/6755f42da02aaf1c2599e7ae/20323/29741340/0/0
DTSTART:20260719T170000Z
DTEND:20260719T220000Z
URL:https://tockify.com/torevent/detail/20323/1784480400000
SUMMARY: La Sopa del Día: Sonic Sancocho
DESCRIPTION:La Sopa del Día - It's a day party - Sonic Sancocho style!\n\
 nJoin the city’s only collective celebrating Latin culture\, cuisine and 
 music through its namesake soup - Sancocho - at this chill afternoon jam 
 in collaboration with Rhythm on Sunday\, July 19. Sonic Sancocho founders
 \, olasconola and Juana Go-gó\, will warm up the space as you arrive\, fo
 llowed by a full crate of top-tier vinyl selections by local DJ\, Derby D
 uro (Changó)\, plus a special guest set by Toro Moratto of the trailblazi
 ng La Pambelé - Bogotá\, Colombia’s next gen salsa brava group\, as an ex
 clusive stop on their national tour.\n\nComplimentary cup of Sancocho for
  ticket holders - please note: first come\, first served. About Sonic San
 cocho: The spice of life in sound\, shared with the community. Much like 
 ingredients in a universal dish - a big pot of soup - here\, platters of 
 sound are spun and served with warm welcome. Musical ingredients from aro
 und the world\, from a local perspective\, for all to share and enjoy. Fo
 unded by selectresses olasconola & Juana Go-gó in Toronto\, Canada\, Soni
 c Sancocho is a community gathering of music and food - two things that n
 ourish heart and soul.They bring forth the B Sides and the beloved of Lat
 in music\, with sounds from around the world\, to your venue through all-
 vinyl DJ sets and dynamic live performances.\n\nSancocho is where all of 
 the ingredients come together and are shared amongst one another - from t
 he starches to the spices and everything in between. We turn up the heat 
 to bring it to a boil\, coming together to enjoy a moment of connection t
 hrough a serving of soup\, within layers of sound\, endless movement and 
 fun.
CATEGORIES:DJ/Club/Rave,Rhythm
X-TKF-FEATURED-IMAGE:https://d3flpus5evl89n.cloudfront.net/6755f3e6a02aaf
 1c2599e757/6a564e956b88f2832019656b/scaled_1024.jpg
X-TKF-CUSTOM-PREVIEW:La Sopa del Día - It's a day party - Sonic Sancocho 
 style! Join the city’s only collective celebrating Latin culture\, cuisin
 e and music through its namesake...
