SUMMARY: Munchiez: The Island Edition
DESCRIPTION:Toronto’s food-inclusive experience returns with reimagined C
 aribbean-inspired flavours\, tropical cocktails\, music\, games & island 
 vibes.\n\n\nMunchiez is a curated food-inclusive social experience built 
 for curious\, culture-minded consumers who love discovering creative flav
 ours\, local culinary talent\, and genuine hospitality. This Caribbean-in
 spired edition brings the energy of the tropics to Toronto through reimag
 ined bites\, bold flavour fusions\, and a vibrant atmosphere designed to 
 bring people together.\n\n\nJoin us for our fourth installment at The Ann
 ex Hotel Wine Bar for an evening of:\n\n🌴Caribbean-inspired bites and re
 imagined creations from local Toronto chefs and vendors\n\n🍹 Signature r
 um cocktails and other beverages available for purchase\n\n🎶 Sounds by C
  The DJ\, connection\, games\, and good vibes\n\n\nWhether you’re a foodi
 e\, a creative\, or simply looking for something different to do in Toron
 to\, Munchiez is designed to bring people together through flavour\, cult
 ure\, and community. Come with your munchies activated\, they’re sure to 
 be satisfied at Munchiez!\n\n\nExperience familiar flavours with a twist 
 inspired by the islands:\n\nThe Island Edition Food Menu\n\nSavoury\n\n  
 * Fruit Chow Salad\n  * Pepper Shrimp Tostones\n  * Oxtail Sushi with Oxt
 ail Gravy\n  * Jerk Chicken Johnny Cakes\n  * Saltfish Plantain Pinwheels
  w/ Bajan Pepper Sauce\n\nSweet\n\n  * Cut Cake Cinnamon Rolls\n  * Rum G
 lazed Fried Dough Bites\n\n\nSignature Cocktail Menu\n\n  * Powered by Wr
 ay & Nephew + Appleton Estate
CATEGORIES:DJ/Club/Rave,The-Annex-Hotel-Lobby-Bar
