URL:https://tockify.com/torevent/detail/20648/1785283200000
SUMMARY: “The Ember Knight Show” Screening and Q&A with Creators and Spec
 ial Guest: Peter Kuplowsky
DESCRIPTION:“The Ember Knight Show” Screening and Q&A with Creators on Ju
 ly 28th With Special Guest: Peter Kuplowsky\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThe cult sensa
 tion Adult Swim Series “The Ember Knight Show” is hitting the road for th
 e first time ever. Created by Ember Knight and directed by Bobby McCoy\, 
 the tour will bring screenings\, live Q&As\, and exclusive merchandise to
  audiences across the United States and Canada while raising funds for th
 e team's first feature film. Featuring special guest moderator TIFF Midni
 ght Madness https://tiff.net/films?list&series=midnight-madness programme
 r Peter Kuplowsky\n\n\n\nWhen: Tuesday\, July 28th\, 2026. 8:00PM-10:00 P
 M\n\n\nWhere: Market Video\, 209 Augusta Avenue\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M5T
  2L4 Canada\n\n\n\nBuy Tickets Here https://www.videostoreage.com/calenda
 r\n\nhttps://www.videostoreage.com/calendar https://www.videostoreage.com
 /calendar\n\n\nEvery stop on the tour will include a screening of the fir
 st season of “The Ember Knight Show\,” an audience Q&A with siblings and 
 co-stars Ember Knight and Eamon Shea\, Moderated by special guests\, and 
 limited advance merchandise available exclusively before the series' phys
 ical release through Video Store.Age https://www.videostoreage.com/ \, ar
 riving for subscribers in August 2026. All profits from screenings and me
 rchandise sales will go directly to funding the adaptation of “The Ember 
 Knight Show” into a full length feature film.\n\n\n\n“The point of the sh
 ow is to tell embarrassing truths about ego and friendship\,” says Ember 
 Knight: “so it’s incredibly liberating to share it with friends and fans 
 around the world who feel like we do.”\n\n\nAbout “The Ember Knight Show”
 \n\n\nCreated by Ember Knight\, “The Ember Knight Show” is a cult comedy 
 series that disguises itself as an instructional etiquette program before
  unraveling into a surreal\, stream-of-consciousness exploration of anxie
 ty\, resentment\, and human behavior. Produced independently for under $8
 \,000 before being acquired by Adult Swim\, the series has earned acclaim
  for its inventive DIY filmmaking\, practical effects\, and singular come
 dic voice. The first season won the Audience Choice Award at Slamdance an
 d features guest appearances from Vera Drew https://www.imdb.com/name/nm3
 511314/ \, Haley Dahl https://www.imdb.com/name/nm8883328/ \, Dino Stamat
 opoulos\, https://www.imdb.com/name/nm0821786/?ref_=fn_t_1 Eamon Shea htt
 ps://www.imdb.com/name/nm9466926/?ref_=fn_t_1 \, and Orin Calcagne https:
 //www.imdb.com/name/nm18220016/?ref_=fn_t_1 . The series will receive its
  first physical release through Video Store.Age in August 2026. “The Embe
 r Knight Show” has been written about in: NYLON https://nam10.safelinks.p
 rotection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nylon.com%2Flife%2Fthe-ember
 -knight-show-interview&data=05%7C02%7Cgeoffrey.stewart%40colorado.edu%7C6
 e1832aed16a4cbd3e5e08dee3be2a39%7C3ded8b1b070d462982e4c0b019f46057%7C1%7C
 1%7C639198603180976436%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIl
 YiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C8000
 0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=nmtwsZbEqBz6z%2FOZ9PF3ulgAd5uNb4rY2LXdd2EJydQ%3D&reserve
 d=0 \, Variety https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%
 3A%2F%2Fvariety.com%2F2021%2Ffilm%2Fnews%2Fslamdance-2022-film-lineup-123
 5129107%2F&data=05%7C02%7Cgeoffrey.stewart%40colorado.edu%7C6e1832aed16a4
 cbd3e5e08dee3be2a39%7C3ded8b1b070d462982e4c0b019f46057%7C1%7C1%7C63919860
 3181003769%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMD
 AwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C80000%7C%7C%7C&s
 data=EXu6EfWWBBJJIc0aHV0qR5fI3Q9vqKf6gVZbOxUMWUQ%3D&reserved=0 \, Deadlin
 e https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fdeadl
 ine.com%2F2022%2F02%2F2022-slamdance-winners-1234926956%2F&data=05%7C02%7
 Cgeoffrey.stewart%40colorado.edu%7C6e1832aed16a4cbd3e5e08dee3be2a39%7C3de
 d8b1b070d462982e4c0b019f46057%7C1%7C1%7C639198603181031103%7CUnknown%7CTW
 FpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkF
 OIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C80000%7C%7C%7C&sdata=7d%2FcR81oDoOZBLF2z8
 9PFw9jIE%2Bi6VPMPAc4Rchu83Y%3D&reserved=0 \, & Talkhouse https://nam10.sa
 felinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Ftalkhouse.com%2Fi-want-
 the-moon-for-free&data=05%7C02%7Cgeoffrey.stewart%40colorado.edu%7C6e1832
