SUMMARY: The pop-punkpocalypse w/ redhed / Wiener Kebab / Ruby Doom / The
  Brghtlights
DESCRIPTION:ITS 2012 AGAIN AND THE WORLDS ENDING! Welcome to the POP-PUNK
 POCALYPSE\, a doomsday Y2K fever dream punk-pop night where the apocalyps
 e showed up fashionably late.\n\nExpect a collapsing timeline of house pa
 rty chaos\, burnt out optimism\, and basement-born anthems as we celebrat
 e the wreckage of growing up online.\n\nHeadlined by redhed for their alb
 um release\, the POP-PUNKPOCALYPSE embodies Y2K panic\, 2012 doomsday con
 spiracy rabbit holes\, and DIY basement show energy that all blur togethe
 r into something loud\, emotional\, and undeniably overexposed.\n\nThis i
 sn’t a throwback—it’s a breakdown. Dress like the world already ended\, b
 ecause it did. You’re not just watching the POP-PUNKPOCALYPSE\, you’re a 
 part of it.
