DESCRIPTION:Toronto Film School’s Summer Acting Academy for Adults!\n\n  
 * August 10 to 14 from 9 a.m. to 3 p.m.\n  * $650\n\nIn this immersive TF
 S Summer Academy https://•%09https:/www.torontofilmschool.ca/academy/acti
 ng-academy \, participants work with Toronto Film School instructors to e
 xplore the craft of acting in a supportive\, hands-on environment. You’ll
  develop foundational skills including character work\, script analysis\,
  blocking\, stagecraft\, and camera awareness while learning how to be au
 thentic and truthful in a role.\n\nGuided by experienced industry profess
 ionals\, you’ll prepare scenes for both live performance and industry-sta
 ndard self-tapes\, building confidence\, control\, and expressive range. 
 This week-long Acting Academy offers an introductory look at the same pra
 ctical\, industry-focused training delivered in Toronto Film School’s ful
 l-time Acting for Film\, TV and Theatre Diploma Program https://www.toron
 tofilmschool.ca/programs/acting/ .\n\n***Applicants must be 18 years of a
 ge or older.
