SUMMARY: Toronto Film School’s Summer Filmmaking Academy for Adults!
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Film School’s Summer Filmmaking Academy for Adults!\n
 \n  * August 10 to 14 from 9 a.m. to 3 p.m.\n  * $650\n\nIn this intensiv
 e TFS Summer Academy https://•%09https:/www.torontofilmschool.ca/academy/
 filmmaking-academy \, participants work alongside Toronto Film School ins
 tructors to explore every stage of filmmaking—from idea to finished short
  film. You’ll rotate through key crew roles as you write a script\, plan 
 a shoot\, film on set\, and edit your project\, gaining a clear picture o
 f how a real production comes together.\n\nGuided by working industry pro
 fessionals\, you’ll collaborate with peers while creating a finished shor
 t film you can use as your first portfolio piece. This week-long academy 
 offers an introductory taste of the same hands-on\, industry-driven learn
 ing that fuels Toronto Film School’s full-time Film Production Diploma Pr
 ogram https://www.torontofilmschool.ca/programs/film-production/ .\n\n***
 Applicants must be 18 years of age or older.
