SUMMARY: Toronto International Tap Dance Festival
DESCRIPTION:The Toronto International Tap Dance Festival (TITDF/To Tap Fe
 st) is a biennial event for all ages produced by Toffan Rhythm Projects. 
 This year\, it will take place on August 21-23.\n\n\nThere will be three 
 days of programming featuring leading international and local tap dancers
  and musicians\, as well as dancers traveling in from all over Canada. In
  total the festival will be presenting 36 artists on stage over two days 
 of shows\, as well as two days of tap dance workshops of various levels\,
  panel discussions\, and a closing night jam session.\n\n\nPlease visit t
 he website linked to this event for more details on festival schedules\, 
 ticket purchases\, and workshop registrations. Follow @totapfest on Insta
 gram and Facebook to keep up with the latest announcements.\n\n\nGot any 
 questions or interested in sponsoring our festival? Feel free to email Ca
 thy at cathy.toffanrhythmprojects@gmail.com mailto:cathy.toffanrhythmproj
 ects@gmail.com
CATEGORIES:Dance---Performance---Theatre,Festival,Tap-Dance,Live-Music
